{"schema_version":3,"catalogue_version":1,"id":"bco:46-7","provision":"BCO 46-7","book":"bco","book_name":"Book of Church Order","abbreviation":"BCO","reference":"46-7","title":"Section 46-7","supplementary":false,"canonical_url":"https://raymond-rishty.github.io/pca-ga/provisions/bco/46-7/","reader_url":"https://raymond-rishty.github.io/pca-constitution-reader/#bco/46-7","current_text":{"html":"<p>No certificate of dismission from either a Session or a Presbytery shall be valid testimony of good standing for a period longer than one (1) year, unless its earlier presentation be hindered by some providential cause; and such certificates given to persons who have left the bounds of the Session or Presbytery granting them shall certify the standing of such persons only to the time of their leaving those bounds.</p>","text":"No certificate of dismission from either a Session or a Presbytery shall be valid testimony of good standing for a period longer than one (1) year, unless its earlier presentation be hindered by some providential cause; and such certificates given to persons who have left the bounds of the Session or Presbytery granting them shall certify the standing of such persons only to the time of their leaving those bounds."},"source":{"name":"PCA Constitution Reader","revision":"14d73f7e5caf1d22e0514870dd30fcc69f8165cc","edition":"Current Reader text","files":{"bco.js":"c88e552545b73fd9690de620b237895b7ea52a94bed8e95690c116bf76be8ae5","wcf.js":"1ebf9e54223f7fe4e728a3e640c833a435af825d74b5ef3d4b04687685538a0d","wlc.js":"f6977e761ea4ccc93b07fcacfd0391890cb05b42f4317d807fa293c078d9b051","wsc.js":"dd775417f7ef21e3283bacad5e6ef193c41d64d03bd5a2e8fb934ccca8cb8e53","rao.js":"49808bbb0e95abdc3b07506c87dde0d62d087851e869b49c0f1f2424986450ec"}},"input_fingerprint":"38e35af46c8cbdb12a9a00c82d72f7192575b5ec27348534148f2a834551edc4","assessment_fingerprint":"517b100d2e9006e313ab6d84d4f0f31593b77832f395383ba2227779470cd034","assessment_summary":{"status":"stale","file":"i